#: /workspace/miryu-software-center/miryu-software-center-main/src/core/Dnf5DaemonClient.cpp:1288
msgid ""
"The dnf5daemon-server session was reset while resolving the transaction. The "
"prepared package changes were lost; please try again."
msgstr ""
"解析事務時 dnf5daemon-server 工作階段已重設。已準備好的軟體包變更已遺失，請重"
"試。"



